63-laohan:m024-0177","start":177,"end":178,"surface":"非","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003739","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m024-0184","start":184,"end":186,"surface":"韓非","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003739","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m024-0194","start":194,"end":196,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003750","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m024-0205","start":205,"end":206,"surface":"非","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003739","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan","book_id":"b-shiji-063","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-063-laohan"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p025","text":"申子、韓子皆著書，傳於後世，學者多有。余獨悲韓子為說難而不能自脫耳。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m025-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"申子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003737","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m025-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"韓子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003739","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m025-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"韓子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003739","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan","book_id":"b-shiji-063","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-063-laohan"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p026","text":"太史公曰：老子所貴道，虛無，因應變化於無為，故著書辭稱微妙難識。莊子散道德，放論，要亦歸之自然。申子卑卑，施之於名實。韓子引繩墨，切事情，明是非，其極慘礉少恩。皆原於道德之意，而老子深遠矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m026-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003752","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m026-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"老子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003720","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m026-0032","start":32,"end"